# --- Secret / credential hardening ---
# Defensive guards against ever committing signing material or credentials to a
# public repository. None of these are tracked today; the patterns exist so an
# accidental `git add` of a real keystore or key file is caught by Git itself.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
keystore.properties
signing.properties
secrets.properties
*.pem
*.key

# Heap dumps and profiling captures may embed in-memory secrets / user data.
*.hprof
# JVM crash reports a test worker leaves in the module directory when it aborts:
# they carry local paths and environment variables, and are never source.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

# Roborazzi / Kover leftover artifacts from local screenshot diffing.
*-actual.png
*_actual.png

# Runtime output of the fastlane tool, if it is ever run locally. The metadata
# tree itself is NOT ignored — see the note below.
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/
fastlane/test_output/

# NOTE — intentionally tracked, do NOT add to this file:
#   * fastlane/metadata/android/**                      — store listing texts,
#     screenshots and changelogs. F-Droid builds its index from the metadata it
#     finds in the *source repository*, so ignoring this directory would make
#     the F-Droid listing empty; the same files are what `supply` uploads to
#     Play, and `StoreMetadataTest` verifies their limits in CI.
#   * app/google-services.json                          — placeholder Firebase
#     config (project_id "android-ai-agent-placeholder", zeroed project_number,
#     placeholder API key) required for local & CI builds; carries no real
#     Firebase identifiers or secrets.
#   * app/src/main/assets/universal_sentence_encoder.tflite — bundled on-device
#     USE embedding model, the default embedding provider; required at runtime.

# --- IDE state ---
# The whole `.idea/` tree is ignored. It is the state of somebody else's IDE:
# it changes on its own as the editor is used, it carries no build or review
# value, and it was already shipping a stale product name in `.name`. Nothing
# in it is needed to build or run the project.
/.idea/
